tick=4 note the refusal is re-observed on the recycled object; the recycle writes no step and the delete in flight already answers it
tick=4 apply pod.admissionRejected[OutOfResource] pod=svc-a-engine-0-default-0 reason=OutOfnvidia.com/gpu now=t+0s
